{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "df1138100040c360aa11292f471c2edce7343ed5c6ea7dfc4c212aa1e9aaf0e8", "ja": "（39プロジェクトの初公演がもうすぐに始まる……。\nが、美希の姿が見当たらない。一体どこに……？）", "zh": "（39PROJECT的首次公演马上就要开始了……\n我却没看到美希出现。她到底在哪……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "72f7ded16879828e914997d2a013e41abdb56a5099d7851ef4519084f266bb8b", "ja": "あ、{$P$}、探してたの～……。\nあふぅ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，终于找到你了～\n啊呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "920bcbda9b5978fa8d7f4334f22938477f97c9ab65750109d49a4d48cbe1e039", "ja": "よかった、ここにいたんだな……って、\n美希も俺を探してたのか？", "zh": "太好了，原来你在这……咦？\n美希也在找我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "1482426b3537c3f882d25032190a22b3f19b268fd0e2570bc7c2be19e0eef019", "ja": "あのね。ミキ、出番までいつものソファーで\nお昼寝しようって思ってたんだけど……。", "zh": "那个呀，美希想在上台前\n去平时的沙发睡个午觉，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "8b349e7cd60fccb30a75d2df7ab7a1449ed65a157cd9a574051162db43134ff9", "ja": "新しいコたちが、ずーっと話しかけてきて。\nぜんぜん寝かせてもらえないの……。ヒドイよね？", "zh": "那些新人一～直跟美希讲话，\n完全不让美希睡觉……是不是很过分？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5566092a78049aca65eeabe44a58d0963774763038053774a1bce6ccb9c0aba3", "ja": "そ、そうだな……。まさか、このタイミングで\n先輩が寝るとは、思ってなかったのかもな。", "zh": "对、对呀……她们应该做梦也没想到\n前辈会想在这种时候睡觉吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "954b7167dc6a4e2e9adb39b070849258136cea6b936f96a5580a90ca165597e6", "ja": "だからー、{$P$}に、\nミキの番をしてもらおうって思って……。あふぅ。", "zh": "所以呢～美希想让{$P$}来\n代替美希跟她们聊天……啊呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "69a6f57e20c4a42a90ee21375728c813782ee4b2d4c6497a0d286b28b0ec390e", "ja": "それじゃ、あとは……よろしくお願いしますなの～……\nむにゃ……。", "zh": "那么，接下来……就交给你了～\n呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "a097a4ca7f71ea7aec73fc3259afe5068f26d8b8c2cbb018cb6abcef782ac98a", "ja": "すぅ……すぅ……。", "zh": "呼……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5f47c4d4e04b1d635dfcc3a3c74e8fc4935599f28a8f5550b4b46369eed18f00", "ja": "……はは、なるほど。寝かせてもらえない原因が、\nわかった気がするけど……おやすみ、美希。", "zh": "……哈哈，原来如此。我好像明白\n她们不让你睡的原因了……好好睡吧，美希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "8ee6de1ca195c57eb67032d01568e182b7e5038154f31ba96627d2636e446c22", "ja": "え？　原因ってなあに？", "zh": "咦？原因是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1011_p", "source_sha256": "94e92fade03c0e3b8de816001e07d7e5d6eb795736bb7400eedf2d435ada20d5", "ja": "うわ、気になる言葉を聞くと起きるんだな？\nまあ、つまり、美希が話しかけられる原因は……。", "zh": "哇，听到有兴趣的话题就爬起来啦？\n这个嘛，我想她们之所以会想找美希聊天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1012ca0b1b483d756d524559bef9a6df108f22a40d7149a1b5d0e14b7b24c664", "ja": "きっと初公演直前の、こんなタイミングでも平然と\n寝られる、美希の落ち着きそのもの、じゃないかな。", "zh": "肯定是因为等等就是首次公演，\n但美希在这种时候还睡得着、依旧冷静沉着的缘故吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "5069208ea3ebd8c321f8cb0ddcb4e2f826c50ed2862dccc5abcd848042b849eb", "ja": "落ち着き？\nでもミキ、普通に寝てるだけだよ？", "zh": "冷静沉着？\n可是美希，就只是在睡觉而已呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1014_p", "source_sha256": "981cec69ed3f8fc6df997cf5d64837d8bee9b39659e00c88989827b17509584b", "ja": "普通に寝るからスゴイんだよ。\n新人はその平静さに触れて、落ち着きたいんだろう。", "zh": "就是这样才厉害啊。\n新人是想借由美希的平静，让自己冷静下来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1015_p", "source_sha256": "95b9c36b348f472663068d856a3b682a6438b806caf239d01a8fe823a42bcce0", "ja": "それくらいドキドキして、\n落ち着かないってことだよ。", "zh": "这也说明了她们现在有多紧张，\n感到多么不安了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "40c5ed33dda8d3724eaebddb93ca81c9741e65b28dda4bd019a7a977b756d7b7", "ja": "ふーん、そんなにドキドキしてるんだ……。", "zh": "哦，原来她们这么紧张呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "4632921d4f2f54e16de0ea42cba82584c7a5a38383698e8f31776b694f06dd64", "ja": "あ！　ミキ、ひらめいちゃったの！", "zh": "啊，美希有个好点子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1018_p", "source_sha256": "cab5e811d1e1bd0f576ea5cf893f51a0987a6d0821d02a481a6b76c249609fe4", "ja": "おっ、さすが先輩だな！\n何を思いついたんだ？", "zh": "喔！不愧是前辈！\n你想到了什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1019_003mik", "source_sha256": "b0ceaef9fce20fb6970690a372797227927bba8a02492d57384dfe08f80dc334", "ja": "もう、みんなで一緒にお昼寝しちゃうのがいいって\n思うな！　そしたらミキも眠れるし～。", "zh": "美希在想，干脆大家一起来睡午觉吧！\n这样美希也能好好睡了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "32f6f7e13c6489f2b8d596f9e18845ade3b31cde9010fb0256e2c0e0e7a7c615", "ja": "みんなのドキドキも、きっと収まるよね？", "zh": "这样大家一定会冷静下来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1021_p", "source_sha256": "586740ed2afc6a8ecf871a21942862f331f2a6ecfeed7c47126aadc946339088", "ja": "……ははっ、なるほど。\n確かにそれは、いいアイデアだと思う。", "zh": "……哈哈，原来如此。\n这确实是个不错的点子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1022_003mik", "source_sha256": "68ed66e32c37cc4a7a6fce4889b3971bb04eb090b2b448c23ced25260f2dc59d", "ja": "だよね♪　それじゃミキ、控え室に戻るね。\nお休みなさい……なの……。あふぅ。", "zh": "对吧♪那美希就先回去准备室啰。\n晚安……唷……啊呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1023_p", "source_sha256": "1b6fe0eb25e10b998cae82c2fb0647beb16f0b54782dee969ae0cd431200c871", "ja": "（本当に眠れるかは疑問だけど……そんなことを提案\nされたら、新人の肩の力も、いい感じに抜けるだろう）", "zh": "（虽然不晓得她们是不是真的睡得着……\n但听到这样的提议，新人也会放松一些吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1024_p", "source_sha256": "6ecab78abbad9f1659fd908aa5108db947345064687645974e9529c3c61bfbe4", "ja": "（美希は美希のままでいい。\nそのままで、本当に……、立派な先輩だ！）", "zh": "（美希只要做自己就好。\n光是这样，真的就是……了不起的前辈了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1025_003mik", "source_sha256": "f9cb7fd7acaefcb44b95516169795f655fad7276e676d1338a7e218151895f7a", "ja": "むにゃ……。いちごババロアくれーぴゅ、\nくらさ～い……なの……。", "zh": "呼……草苺巴巴露亚可丽饼，\n快给美希吃……唷……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1026_p", "source_sha256": "7205cad1152b22079960a2deb03a02b613c935935870be4f2326d81b30c50af5", "ja": "しまった、控え室にたどりつく前に眠っていたか！\n美希、起きるんだ！　おーい！", "zh": "糟糕，在走到准备室前就睡着了！\n美希，快起床啊！喂──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1027_p", "source_sha256": "fbb541409252fde0dc874ed910ea6e64c43ca04d7111e74e54eb71dda7a13c2a", "ja": "（先輩になっても、後輩ができても、劇場ができても。\n美希はいつも通り、マイペースなまま）", "zh": "（即使成为前辈、身后有了新人、成立了新剧场，\n美希依旧不变，维持故我。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_003_1028_p", "source_sha256": "d95e307104acac2417096f2a9ecb28303ec869a2228634ee8bcfcae699b4ac94", "ja": "（新人達には、きっと何よりの目標になるだろう。\nどんな時でもこの子は美希……アイドル星井美希だ！）", "zh": "（对新人们而言，她肯定会是最好的憧憬对象。\n无论何时，她就是美希……偶像星井美希！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
